| F3 | open | SUGGESTION | js/postStoryTestAutomationResults.js | 💡 suggestion pin the f1 route at the automation leg integration layer not only at the triage layer the f1 fix s user visible contract lives in poststorytestautomationresults js a validated own oracle red on an environment shift must end in routepathresult — status test maintenance the bug untouched the finding in the ledger digest this is covered by 22 new cases in test tctriage js but the automation leg suite test poststorytestautomationresults js has no own oracle triage case every differential park and route test there gh 1345 differential dispatcher hand off the bounce suite uses guard roles routeverdict routepathresult wiring is role agnostic today so nothing pins that a role normalization regression e g resolvetcrole demoting own cannot silently re enter the ac gated path through the automation leg two cheap integration cases would close it 1 validated own oracle same build changed envfingerprint → run result status test maintenance maintenancetestcases ts x no bug move environment shift finding in the ledger 2 validated own oracle build changed no differential outcome → park label tc differential pending added with the parked request carrying role own oracle the field the dispatcher s dispatcherroleof round trips — this anchors the full f1 f2 loop end to end |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
